; water.xon -- the Delve's water, deep and shallow, by band: each kind's
;   whole picture, and the rims, rounded corners and notches that join
;   a pool's cells into one (see roguelike/frame, frame-join-parts),
;   its bank cut from the band's own plain floor.  The read and the
;   form as tiles.xon.

